10         stratified by maternal obesity
11         Exposures: &mowestq_ [quantiles]; &mopaq_ [quantiles]; &mosmk_ [categorical]; &moshift_ [categorical];
12         	moob [binary]
13         Stratifiers: maternal obesity
14         Statistical Analyses:
15         	1) proc genmod to calculate multivariable log-binomial model with generalized estimating equations (GEE),
16         	a Poisson distribution, and an unstructured correlation structure, accounting for correlations across
